      thesis: pair("Source catalog는 고정 표적을 many-to-one island로 압축하는 선택 연산자다. Coverage·local light·source identity·target flux를 다른 변수로 보존해야 검출 누락이 광도 bias인지 반증할 수 있다.", "A source catalog is a selection operator that compresses fixed targets into many-to-one islands. Coverage, local light, source identity, and target flux must remain separate variables before catalog omission can be tested as photometric bias."),
      design: pair("Hash-pinned CAL/i2d/segm→142 target frame→collision graph→48환경 one-at-a-time injections→DOLPHOT·fixed-scene 독립 fit→odd-ID component gate 순으로 진행한다.", "Proceed from hash-pinned CAL/i2d/segm products through the 142-target frame, collision graph, 48-environment one-at-a-time injections, independent DOLPHOT and fixed-scene fits, and the odd-ID component gate."),
